      "content": "hey, i just saw the results from the enzyme pilot study. the p-value came in at 0.06, which is a bit of a bummer since we really needed that 0.05 mark for the board. \n\nwe have that big funding pitch on friday and i need to present these findings. how should we frame these results to the investors so they see the potential here? we can't afford to lose this round.",
